/**
 * T796 — stores created before the canonical `upstream` ledger existed gain it
 * additively on their next init. Fixtures are immutable artifacts generated by
 * T794's first parent, 9ad31c918fac51ef20fa48e4a9eaaeca28f9dbb3. Current
 * initialization code never participates in constructing legacy state.
 *
 * Shared assertions are Behavioral-Active Blackbox. Adapter-specific raw
 * comparisons are Graybox checks of persisted rows, counters, archives, and
 * log artifacts.
 */

